{
  "_comment": [
    "N-069: shared corpus for the --ir loader's required-field presence/type check.",
    "Each case is `control` with ONE field removed or retyped; `error` is the exact diagnostic",
    "every tier must print (the F-084 stem). Required set = anf-ir.schema.json required keys,",
    "minus the ones the loaders deliberately default (loop start/step, add_output preimage)."
